&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3165 - Account Director, Data Operations&amp;nbsp; - GCS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The Data Delivery &amp;amp; Project Manager is responsible for the end-to-end coordination, quality assurance, and governance of media data within the Cockpit programme across multiple markets. Acting as the central point of contact between local market teams, global Nestlé stakeholders, and external data partners, this role ensures the timely delivery of accurate, high-quality data that supports &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;MMM&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;modelling&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;business&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;decision-making.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;The&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;successful&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;candidate&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;will&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;drive&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;process&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;consistency,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;manage&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;complex&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;stakeholder&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;relationships,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;resolve&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;data-related&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;issues,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;oversee&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;programme&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;timelines&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;ensure&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;smooth&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;efficient&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;execution&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;across&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;all&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;participating&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Delivery and Project Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and maintain the Cockpit refresh calendar&amp;nbsp;for&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;all participating markets, ensuring alignment with MMM modelling timelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with local market teams, data processing vendors (e.g., Redmill), and global &amp;amp; z-EUR Nestle to ensure timely submission of accurate data to meet cockpit calendar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage ad-hoc refresh requests and assess feasibility against resource and process constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Quality Assurance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and validate incoming media plan data for completeness, accuracy, and adherence to agreed formats (e.g., no channels with impressions but zero spend).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform central QA checks&amp;nbsp;before data is loaded into Cockpit, or oversee local QA when/if decentralised.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve data discrepancies (e.g., spend, impressions, reach) with local teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Governance &amp;amp; Standardisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;E&lt;strong&gt;nforce agreed actualisation processes&amp;nbsp;f&lt;/strong&gt;or Cockpit markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistent application of data governance rules, including mandatory metrics, cost allocation, and added value treatment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;central point of contact for the cockpit program&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;between:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Local OpenMind (OM) market teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Nestlé stakeholders (e.g., Z-EUR, IT)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data processing vendors (e.g., Redmill)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate alignment calls to resolve blockers and ensure all parties are informed of timelines, dependencies, and changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly on delays, risks, and mitigation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in media planning, buying, or media operations&amp;nbsp;with a deep understanding of campaign structures, channels, and metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multi-market data workflows&amp;nbsp;and working with multiple stakeholders across geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to interpret and troubleshoot media data&amp;nbsp;(spend, impressions, reach, CPM/CPC calculations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills, able to manage multiple deadlines and priorities in a fast-moving&amp;nbsp;environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to explain technical data issues to non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail and commitment to data accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Chainguard is the trusted source for open source. By delivering hardened, secure, and production-ready builds of all the open source software engineers and AI agents rely on, Chainguard helps organizations build faster, stay compliant, and eliminate risk.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our customers include Fortune 500 enterprises and global industry leaders, including Anduril, Canva, Fortinet, Hewlett Packard Enterprise, OpenAI, Snap Inc., and Snowflake. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Chainguard is venture-backed by leading investors, including Amplify, IVP, Kleiner Perkins, Lightspeed Venture Partners, Mantis VC, Redpoint Ventures, Sequoia Capital, and Spark Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The role, in a nutshell:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Chainguard we&#39;re focused on securing the software supply chain, and we&#39;re building the next generation of products at the intersection of security and AI. We&#39;re looking for an engineering manager to lead a fast-moving team shipping tools that developers will actually use — the Guardener, hardened GitHub Actions, Chainguard Agent Skills, and new products built on our microVM sandbox platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own these products end-to-end: hire and grow the team, set the roadmap with Product, and stay hands-on enough to dig into the code. This is a high-ownership role for someone who moves fast, takes initiative, and measures success by what ships and who uses it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a portfolio of products end-to-end — the Guardener, hardened GitHub Actions, Chainguard Agent Skills, and emerging microVM-based products — from roadmap through implementation, rollout, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, lead, and grow a small team of strong engineers. Remove blockers and create the conditions for them to do their best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay technically hands-on: review designs and PRs, prototype when it unblocks the team, and unblock the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product on a roadmap with real deadlines — help the team prioritize tradeoffs and ship iteratively rather than waiting for perfect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate ambiguous problems and find a clear path forward. You take initiative rather than waiting for complete specs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the quality and reliability of what you ship, and stay close to customers to turn their feedback directly into the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience managing engineers with a genuine, sustained passion for leading and growing a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of shipping products or major features and owning the results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical background — you can still read code, review designs, and reason about architecture and tradeoffs. Proficiency with Go or strong readiness to ramp quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building CI/CD systems, developer tooling, or product-facing platforms; familiarity with containers, Kubernetes, and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI tooling and genuine enthusiasm for applying it to complex customer problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with autonomy and ambiguity, a bias for action, and a habit of shipping iteratively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a collaborative spirit working closely with Product and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Explore Our Work&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dive into the practical side of what we do at Chainguard. These resources provide a hands-on look at our processes and offer an opportunity for in-depth understanding of our product offerings and the technology behind them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chainguard Academy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;https://www.chainguard.dev&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$229,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$258,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We live and breathe our company values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are customer obsessed — We focus on delivering solutions to our customers that create value and make their lives better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have a bias for intentional action — We prioritize, plan, try things, and fail fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We don&#39;t take ourselves too seriously (but we do serious work) — We are solving an important problem which takes focus, but we also like to enjoy the journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We trust each other and assume good intentions — We&#39;re transparent with decisions to empower team members to make well informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few of the benefits we offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible &amp;amp; Remote-First Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Work remotely with team meetup opportunities, bi-annual destination summits, and a monthly stipend for coworking spaces, phone and internet costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Approach to Equity:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive stock options upon hire and promotion. Plus, you can participate in secondary offerings and have 10 years to exercise your options (yes, you read that correctly: 10 years!).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;100% Covered Health Insurance:&lt;/strong&gt; We cover 100% of your health, vision and dental insurance premiums for you and your dependents. Nothing comes out of your paycheck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;∞ Flexible Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; Take the time you need – to do our best work, we need to recharge and reset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;18 Weeks Paid Parental Leave:&lt;/strong&gt; We offer 18 weeks for birthing parents and 12 weeks for non-birthing parents, with the option to use it all at once or throughout your child&#39;s first year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If your experience is close but doesn&#39;t fulfill all requirements, please apply. We&#39;re building the best team in technology and are focused on hiring &quot;Chainguardians&quot; with unique backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chainguard is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics. We also consider qualified applicants with criminal histories, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that Chainguard will process your personal data in accordance with &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.chainguard.dev/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Chainguard&#39;s Global Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;©2026 Chainguard. All Rights Reserved.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;The &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Select Major Accounts&lt;/strong&gt; team is Samsara’s primary engine for enterprise growth, responsible for landing high-value, net-new logos across the UK &amp;amp; Ireland’s largest physical operations. In this role, you will lead multi-million-dollar, full-cycle sales processes from a cold start—executing a disciplined qualification playbook, building true C-suite champions, and closing strategic &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;385&quot;&gt;$1M+ ARR deals&lt;/strong&gt;. This position is built for an elite, strategic Account Executive who thrives in complex, multi-stakeholder environments—equally comfortable navigating IT and lines of business to digitize industries traditionally reliant on legacy systems.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Now? &lt;/strong&gt;Samsara combines the agility of a high-growth startup, the market authority of a public company, and the momentum of a hyper-scale tech leader. Named a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;176&quot;&gt;Best Place to Work for 3 consecutive years&lt;/strong&gt;, we offer enterprise sellers a combination of unique differentiators:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven Leadership &amp;amp; Hyper-Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Founded by serial entrepreneurs with a history of building multi-billion-dollar companies, Samsara has scaled past &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;149&quot;&gt;$2.1B+ ARR&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;165&quot;&gt;30%+ YoY &lt;/strong&gt;global growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Market-Dominating Platform:&lt;/strong&gt; Backed by $2.8B+ in R&amp;amp;D investment, our Connected Operations Cloud makes us the Category Leader delivering class-leading AI, IoT, and telematics capabilities with a genuine AI moat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Massive Untapped Market:&lt;/strong&gt; Physical operations represent a $160B+ Global TAM, with EMEA remaining &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;95&quot;&gt;99% greenfield opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;This brings&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt; strong upside &lt;/strong&gt;earning potential on a winning trajectory, rapid professional growth alongside elite sales talent, and a massive, unpenetrated territory waiting to be captured.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Whilst we do support remote working, flexibility is required to travel to visit customers onsite across the region as required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to impact the industries that run our world: &lt;/strong&gt;Your efforts will result in real-world impact—helping to keep the lights on, get food into grocery stores, and most importantly, ensure workers return home safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mantra is #alwaysbeprospecting:&lt;/strong&gt; The world of operations is vast. Your customers are often out in the field and the best way to catch them is live on the phone. Samsara’s top reps do constant research to find companies and contacts to expand their pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have innate curiosity in how businesses work:&lt;/strong&gt; One day you’ll meet with someone in waste management and the next you may be learning about the inner workings of a food distribution center. Our top sales team members seek to learn the ins and outs of the businesses they support in order to make a larger impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are a life-long learner: &lt;/strong&gt;Samsara sales are complex. You will need to learn about businesses where you previously had little knowledge. The payoff is big but you have to be willing to put in the work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You build genuine relationships with your customers: &lt;/strong&gt;The industries we serve have relied on pen-and-paper solutions for years and haven’t been met with the type of technology we offer. Our customers value earned trust and human relationships built over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to be with the best: &lt;/strong&gt;Samsara’s high-performance Sales culture means you’ll be surrounded by the best and challenged to go farther than you have before.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Executive-Level relationships within strategic, named accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own customer engagements end-to-end, from prospecting and qualification to close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate excellent solution-based sales process in complex sales campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobilize a large matrix virtual team of business stakeholders to include Operations, Finance, IT, dedicated Solution Engineer and Account Development Representative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion, role model, and embed Samsara’s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally and across new offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Min. 7+ years&lt;/strong&gt; full-cycle Enterprise-level Account Executive closing expertise, winning complex SAAS deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven track record&lt;/strong&gt; of consistent quota over-achievement in complex accounts and $1M+ ARR deal execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;New Logo &amp;amp; Self-generated pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to build and win deals through a repeatable outbound prospecting motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Structured Qualification:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery of Playbook methodology-led selling (e.g. MEDDPICC / Command of the Message / Force Management) to quantify genuine business pain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Champion &amp;amp; Economic Buyer navigation:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to test and build true champions, access executive buying centres, and engineer compelling events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Team player used to winning as a team, collaborative and within a coachable growth mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ideal candidate also has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awards for elite achievement (particularly President’s Club, Winner’s circle, Top 10%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about transformational technology in the world operations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited about solving new problems in innovative ways&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we build for the people who keep the global economy moving. We want owners, not passengers, which is why &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;our rewards&lt;/a&gt; are designed to fuel high-impact builders. Our compensation program delivers above-market total compensation through a combination of base salary, performance-based bonus/variable pay, and equity (for eligible roles) in a high-growth public company. We meaningfully differentiate pay for our top performers, who have the opportunity to earn above-market compensation that can outpace the broader market over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond compensation, we provide the foundations that enable long-term success: a flexible, employee-led remote model, a professional development stipend, comprehensive health and parental leave plans, and more. If you’re ready to build for the long term and own the outcome, your journey starts here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Samsara, we embrace a flexible working model that caters to the diverse needs of our teams. Our offices are open for those who prefer to work in-person and we also support remote work where it aligns with our operational requirements. For certain positions, being close to one of our offices or within a specific geographic area is important to facilitate collaboration, access to resources, or alignment with our service regions. In these cases, the job description will clearly indicate any working location requirements. Our goal is to ensure that all members of our team can contribute effectively, whether they are working on-site, in a hybrid model, or fully remotely. All offers of employment are contingent upon an individual’s ability to secure and maintain the legal right to work at the company and in the specified work location, if applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging at Samsara&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we welcome everyone regardless of their background. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, and other characteristics protected by law. We depend on the unique approaches of our team members to help us solve complex problems and want to ensure that Samsara is a place where people from all backgrounds can make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is an inclusive work environment, and we are committed to ensuring equal opportunity in employment for qualified persons with disabilities. Please email &lt;a ---------- or &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DrM6DFQUiSgfPtCVA&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; if you require any reasonable accommodations throughout the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Authenticity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use &lt;a href=&quot;https://hiretofu.com/privacyPolicy&quot;&gt;Tofu&lt;/a&gt;, a fraud detection tool, to validate the authenticity of applications and protect against identity fraud. This ensures we are connecting with real people and allows us to prioritize genuine candidates. Please see Samsara’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraudulent Employment Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is aware of scams involving fake job interviews and offers. Please know we do not charge fees to applicants at any stage of the hiring process. Official communication about your application will only come from emails ending in ----- ----- or ----- For more information regarding fraudulent employment offers, please visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://samsara.com/blog/avoiding-fake-job-offers&quot;&gt;blog post here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a&lt;strong&gt; security-cleared (enhanced UK Government)&lt;/strong&gt; Senior Systems Engineer to join our Public Sector, Defence and Defence Industrial Base team as a trusted senior technical pre-sales partner to our Account Executives and channel partners across the UK and Ireland. In this role, you will help government departments, defence customers, and defence industrial base partners understand how our storage and data platform solutions solve mission critical business and technical challenges, and you will play a key part in advancing opportunities from discovery through technical validation and close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly collaborative, customer facing role for a senior technical professional with strong storage fundamentals, a consultative mindset, and the confidence to engage in technical conversations with senior stakeholders across government, defence, and industry. A meaningful part of the role is also enabling partner SEs so they can independently position and scale our solutions across the public sector and defence market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is remote based. There is an expectation that you will travel regularly across the UK and Ireland to meet customers and partners in person, including on-site visits to government, defence, and defence industrial base locations as required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Account Executives on public sector and defence opportunities, joining discovery conversations, territory planning, shaping solution direction, and helping move deals forward through the funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior technical lead within a pool of SEs supporting the Public Sector, Defence and Defence Industrial Base business, providing mentorship and technical direction to less experienced colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer requirements, including those with specific government and defence security, accreditation, and compliance considerations, into clear technical architectures, proposals, sizing, quotes, and solution concepts that build confidence and accelerate decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run technical presentations, demos, workshops, and follow-up sessions for government departments, defence customers, and defence industrial base primes and SMEs, both remotely and on-site across the UK and Ireland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable and coach channel partner SEs through workshops, bootcamps, and joint customer engagement so partners can better position and scale solutions across the public sector and defence market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate technical fit for opportunities, including storage architecture, protocols, virtualisation environments, and broader infrastructure considerations, with attention to the security and resilience requirements common in government and defence environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across Systems Engineering, Sales, Partners, Support, Product, and other internal teams to solve customer challenges and deliver a strong buying experience for public sector and defence stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in internal training, pipeline reviews, technical enablement, and ongoing knowledge sharing across the team, including sharing domain expertise on public sector and defence procurement and requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of relevant experience in pre-sales, systems engineering, solution architecture, or a similar customer facing technical role in the technology industry, ideally including experience with public sector, defence, or defence industrial base customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grounding in storage and infrastructure fundamentals; storage experience is strongly preferred, and post-sales experience can also be relevant if paired with customer facing commercial capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of block, file, and object storage, along with related technologies such as FC, iSCSI, NAS, SAN, virtualisation, and VMware-style environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with UK government and defence procurement frameworks (such as G-Cloud and Crown Commercial Service frameworks), security classifications, and accreditation processes is highly valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead consultative technical discovery and engage confidently with senior customers, prospects, and partners across government, defence, and industry in both business and technical conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills, with the ability to explain complex technical ideas clearly and credibly to both technical and non-technical audiences, including senior government and defence stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, curious, and proactive working style, with a willingness to learn quickly, excellent technical discovery and qualification skills, and the confidence to ask questions when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or through channel partners and defence industrial base primes and SMEs is highly valuable, as partner enablement is a significant part of the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment while maintaining strong attention to detail and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Completed enhanced UK Government security vetting required.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: this role can be based remotely anywhere in the UK. Regular travel across the UK to be on-site with customers and partners should be expected as a core part of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
