&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workato delivers the enterprise infrastructure for the agentic era, redefining iPaaS and unifying data, applications, processes, and AI into a single, governed platform. Workato serves as both the &lt;strong&gt;control plane&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;action (execution) plane&lt;/strong&gt; for agentic use cases — governing how AI agents are authorized, orchestrated, and monitored while reliably executing the work they trigger across every connected system. A visionary in Enterprise MCP and trusted by 50% of the Fortune 500, Workato&#39;s cloud-native architecture connects every application, data source, and process to power real-time orchestration at scale. With enterprise-grade security and continuous innovation at its core, Workato gives organizations a trusted foundation to deploy agents with confidence — setting the policies and guardrails in the control plane and carrying out actions in the execution plane to operationalize AI across the business. To learn more, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.workato.com&quot;&gt;www.workato.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
