&lt;li&gt;Data Engineering &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adoption &amp;amp; Change Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our consultants are encouraged to think beyond project delivery. We look for individuals who are naturally curious, commercially aware, and passionate about helping clients succeed. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to build trusted relationships, identify new opportunities, influence strategic decisions, and play a key role in shaping our clients&#39; data journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Consultant role is a client-facing consulting position within Consulting Services, focused on leading Data, Analytics and AI engagements using Microsoft technologies such as&lt;strong&gt; Microsoft Fabric, Azure Databricks, Azure Data Factory, Azure Synapse, Azure SQL and Power BI&lt;/strong&gt;. The role combines hands-on technical delivery, modern data platform architecture, governance, data engineering and analytics expertise with strong consulting, stakeholder management and communication skills. Responsibilities include leading workshops and technical engagements, designing scalable and secure data solutions, supporting pre-sales and proposals, mentoring consultants, managing delivery risks and helping clients realize business value from their data and technology investments, with occasional UK and international travel required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the delivery of complex Data, Analytics, AI and platform modernization projects using Microsoft technologies, including&lt;strong&gt; Microsoft Fabric, Azure Databricks and other Azure data services.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate client workshops, discovery sessions and technical engagements, translating business requirements into practical data and analytics solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design scalable, secure and well-governed data platform architectures that align with client objectives and industry best practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership throughout project delivery, ensuring solutions meet agreed quality, performance and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support business development activities by contributing to pre-sales engagements, solution architecture, estimates and commercial proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
